//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
//
// charattr.def, authored for the charattr tests (fixtures/README.md)
//
// JO:CA's layout: the live classes 1 and 5..9, a commented-out block
// of retired sections, then the legacy block (a second CHARACTER1,
// CHARACTER2..4 and a second CHARACTER5, with the legacy keys and
// PREF_WEAP lists the loader reads nothing of). Every value is ours.
//
//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////


